	(text_box "Power hub — 24 V in (screw terminal) → reverse protection + TVS → 5 × TPS26600 eFuse → JST VH outputs.\nOutputs: rows A, B, C, D (one feed per row, daisy-chained bay to bay) and AUX.\nRTN is tied to GND: reverse polarity is handled by Q1, so the eFuses' own reverse blocking is not needed."
